  "body": "## Goal\n\nMake the dashboard usable on narrow screens and respect reduced-motion preferences.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Replace `transition: all` with explicit property lists where still present.\n- Smooth scroll behavior and loading spinner animation should honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.\n- Mobile layout should keep navigation available or provide an accessible fallback when the sidebar is hidden.\n- Wide tables should get responsive wrapping, horizontal scroll affordance, or card-style rows on mobile.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` disables non-essential animation/smooth scrolling.\n- No remaining `transition: all` in the template.\n- Model Breakdown and Usage History remain readable on phone-width viewports.\n- Sidebar/nav is not simply lost on mobile without an alternate path to sections/settings.\n\n## Notes\n\nThis is intentionally separate from PR 14, which should stay focused on source adapters, data correctness, provenance, and the Tool Sources density cleanup.",
